{
  "version": 5,
  "title": "Pi Usage — Coding Insights",
  "description": "WakaTime-style coding-time dashboard from pi-usage OTLP spans. Queries the traces stream directly with SQL; no pipeline needed. OpenObserve stores span duration in microseconds.",
